abstract: "Open VideoGraph Schema is an open-source JSON Schema specification designed to structure multimodal video analytics, shot/scene segmentation, character identification, emotional valence curves, topic modeling, and LightRAG Knowledge Graphs into interoperable, verifiable data artifacts."
